lies, bioluminescent seas, and the night sky/stars.\n\nThe artwork labeled with a \"0\" is his most up to date version of his main design. \nHe also has an alternative outfit.\nYou are free to simplify whatever design you use as needed.\nAlternatively, you're free to dress him in something of your own creation, if you prefer!\n\nI'm happy to leave everything to your discretion! I trust your judgement.\nYou are free to decline for any reason.\n\nThank you for the opportunity!\nI hope you have a lovely day!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-r4Y6ehgCLlHOfKLq6XlEPk8v8GD0laZ", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@starfield_mira/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3800562, "client_id": 1171600, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d3eede7/uploads/origins/a9667dea-94e5-4bc8-9177-a63a3cc952c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bbc18017a7a5d8f890274e0f106c2fd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8d3eede7/uploads/origins/a9667dea-94e5-4bc8-9177-a63a3cc952c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bbc18017a7a5d8f890274e0f106c2fd, https://si.imgix.net/8d3eede7/uploads/origins/a9667dea-94e5-4bc8-9177-a63a3cc952c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f52e2ae24bf5739685d98e9116f6f12 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8d3eede7/uploads/origins/a9667dea-94e5-4bc8-9177-a63a3cc952c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=865ee2bd5aa3db72b345f05146028fd1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d3eede7/uploads/origins/a9667dea-94e5-4bc8-9177-a63a3cc952c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e41b9d16dc2703e33ab44bc0b00709ae", "srcset": "htt